data: {"node_id": "__interrupt__", "label": "Awaiting Human Review", "type": "system", "status": "paused", "output": {"draft_email": "Dear Carlos,\n\nThank you for reaching out. We\u2019ve reviewed the data for your restaurant and identified the key factors driving the high food\u2011cost percentage.\n\n**1. Truffle oil quantity**  \nThe Smash Burger recipe lists 500\u202fml of truffle oil. At 8.5\u202fcents per milliliter, that amounts to \u20ac42.50\u2014almost the entire cost of the dish. It appears to be a data\u2011entry typo; the intended amount is likely 5\u202fml or a similarly small quantity. Correcting this will reduce the recipe cost dramatically.\n\n**2. Recipe cost vs. sale price**  \nWith the current entry, the recipe cost is \u20ac45.35 while the sale price is \u20ac14.50, resulting in a negative margin of about \u2013213\u202f%. Once the truffle oil amount is corrected, the cost will drop to a level that supports a healthy margin.\n\n**3. Overall food\u2011cost percentage**  \nBecause the Smash Burger dominates the cost data, the overall food\u2011cost percentage sits at 55\u202f% instead of the target 30\u202f%. After the recipe is updated, the overall percentage should move closer to your goal.\n\n**4. Minor rounding difference**  \nThe system shows a slight rounding difference (46.60\u202f\u20ac vs. 45.35\u202f\u20ac). This is negligible compared to the main issue.\n\nOur system team is correcting the truffle oil quantity and recalculating the recipe cost on your behalf. The updated figures will appear in the app within a few moments, provided there is something to adjust. We\u2019ll also run a quick audit of any other recipes you have to catch similar errors.\n\nOnce the data is refreshed, you\u2019ll see the revised cost for the Smash Burger and an updated overall food\u2011cost percentage. If the percentage remains higher than expected, we can explore further adjustments to ingredient pricing or additional recipes.\n\nThe haddock Support Team", "thread_id": "26922e93-aecf-40a0-ba7a-364134d4f5d4"}, "description": "Agent paused for human review."}

